\f3\b\fs18 \cf2 WARNING:\
TAMPERING WITH STASIS TECHNOLOGY INVALIDATES THE WARRANTY OF YOUR LIFE\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs22 \cf2 \
Hayley snorted. She wondered what kind of lawyer coke-head came up with that wording. Clearly, they never expected to have it tested in court.\
That should have been a warning.\
Hayley noticed the green bulbous chamber was connected to the rest of the apparatus by two cables at both ends.\
\'93Too easy,\'94 she said, and started screwing with the chamber by unscrewing the cables.\
That\'92s when an ear-splitting alarm screamed so loud her toenails quaked, and strobe lighting flashed so hideously she could barely contain the urge to vomit. A squad of paramilitaries\'97wearing 
\fs18 SHAKTI ENTERPRISES
\fs22  insignias, dark glasses, and ear plugs\'97came in and trained particle weapons at her.
